#showas:极限 2
Even more extremely difficult scenario. Two AIs this time which are set to the maximum difficulty of 10.

Map type is "realistic", with 80 planets, pretty much considered the default. The AIs are only a Full Ensemble, nothing special.

Your starting fleets are all the default options.

This definitely is not fair, in any way. You now have to deal with double the waves, two homeworld assaults, and a lot more firepower being sent your way than before.

This is more like what the first game had, which was always two AIs. Beating this is definitely considered a bug.

If you manage this, there's still more scenarios...